Ahk.  I couldn't even quote it right...

MS44-DA is a pair of MS44-CAs
MS44-DC is a quad of MS44-CAs.

It's vaguely possible you could buy a single -CA board for some weird
system, but usually you should see them advertised as a set of 2 or 4 (check
with the vendor to be sure).

For 4Mb boards, it went:

MS44L-BA is a pair of MS44L-AAs
MS44L-BC is a quad of MS44L-AAs.

